{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI/issues/44","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI/issues/44/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI/issues/44/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI/issues/44/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI/issues/44","id":5708660064,"node_id":"I_kwDOU7m4nM8AAAABVEM9YA","number":44,"title":"详细页编辑：截止时间","user":{"login":"Miaotofu01","id":196646782,"node_id":"U_kgDOC7iXfg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/196646782?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01","html_url":"https://github.com/Miaotofu01","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":12540536715,"node_id":"LA_kwDOU7m4nM8AAAAC63lniw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI/labels/ready-for-agent","name":"ready-for-agent","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"Fully specified, ready for an AFK agent","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-05T08:13:46Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T08:17:44Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":2,"total_blocked_by":2,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Parent\n\n#30\n\n## What to build\n\n在任务详细页改**截止时间**，走结构化输入而不是自然语言：先选日期，再选时间。一个「全天」开关在「有具体时刻」与「只有日期」之间切换。要能**清除**截止时间，把任务变回「没有日期」。\n\n本地守卫要盯住两条：\n\n- **绝不触碰重复规则。** 改一个重复任务的截止时间时，客户端一个字都不许动它的重复规则；而给一个没有日期的任务写重复规则会被服务端**静默清空**，所以没有日期的任务绝不写重复规则。\n- **非法日期在本地拦下**，请求根本不出门——否则三天后在手机上才会发现任务没有日期。\n\n时区字段原样保留并回写，这样改动不会让截止时间静默位移；回写时把服务端给的未知字段一并带回。\n\n服务端在写入截止时间时会自动补一个同值的开始时间（v1 实测观察，文档没写）——**不能假定它总会发生，也不能假定它不会**，按观测记录处理，不要写死。\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- [ ] 详细页的截止时间字段用结构化输入改：先选日期、再选时间\n- [ ] 「全天」开关能在「有具体时刻」与「只有日期」之间切换\n- [ ] 能把截止时间清除，任务变回「没有日期」\n- [ ] 改截止时间时重复规则一字节不变\n- [ ] 没有日期的任务绝不写入重复规则\n- [ ] 非法日期在发出前被本地拦下，请求不出门\n- [ ] 时区字段原样保留并回写，截止时间不发生静默位移\n- [ ] 回写带上服务端给的未知字段\n- [ ] 有测试钉死「改截止时间」的请求形状\n\n## Blocked by\n\n- #43\n- #32\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI/issues/44/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI/issues/44/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}